## group: forbidden health-metric field names
#   GTL1 band SDK exposes blood sugar / uric acid / blood pressure / body
#   temperature. Those are CAPABILITY SPILLOVER, not product requirements
#   (gtl1-integration-brief-2026-09-18.md section 8.4 "能力溢出不得变成需求（防误用）",
#   and its core-conclusion card: "「SDK 里有的字段」不等于「我们该收的字段」"). They
#   must never reach the
#   client mini-program bundle.
#
#   CURATION DECISION ON RECORD: the bare term "temp" is REJECTED. ASCII terms
#   here are matched against identifier segments, so a bare "temp" would fire
#   on the harmless "template" / "temporary" / "tempDir" and produce permanent
#   false positives -- the same failure mode the scan2 curation note records for
#   the bare CJK term. The full field names below are required.
blood_sugar
uric_acid
blood_pressure
body_temp
